{
  "info": {
    "name": "HRIS Mobile API",
    "description": "Koleksi endpoint mobile HRIS (/api/v1 + upload file). Cara pakai:\n1. Import file ini ke Postman.\n2. Isi variable baseUrl (cth. http://localhost:3000).\n3. Jalankan request \"Login\" lebih dulu — cookie sesi tersimpan otomatis di cookie jar Postman.\n4. Akun harus sudah ditautkan ke data karyawan oleh HR, kalau tidak endpoint ESS membalas 403.\n\nEnvelope sukses: { success: true, data: ... }. Gagal: { success: false, error: ... }.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"employee@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Employee123!\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Saya (Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
